{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_troubleshooting_regdb_e_classnotreg", "label": "COMException 0x80040154 (REGDB_E_CLASSNOTREG)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#comexception-0x80040154-regdb_e_classnotreg-at-runtime", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The most common integration failure: the executable project is missing the direct ComInterop PackageReference, so the native activation DLL was never copied to its output directory."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_wingetunavailable_causes", "label": "WinGetUnavailableException causes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#wingetunavailableexception", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordered by likelihood: WinGet/App Installer not installed, WinGet too old for the pinned 1.29.x interop contract, or COM activation blocked in the process context after the lower-trust fallback already failed."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_invalidcastexception_enumeration", "label": "InvalidCastException while enumerating", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#invalidcastexception-no-such-interface-supported-while-enumerating", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Caused by converting an indexed for loop over a CsWinRT-projected collection into foreach/LINQ; only indexer access (.Count / [i]) works in interop 1.29.280. Library loops carry fence comments, and IWinGetClient results are safe because they are plain List<T> copies."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_installer_prohibits_elevation", "label": "0x8A150056 installer prohibits elevation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#install-fails-with-0x8a150056-installer-prohibits-elevation", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolve by running the process non-elevated for that package, or by checking ElevationRequirement from package details before deciding how to launch."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_command_requires_admin", "label": "0x8A150019 command requires admin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#install-fails-with-0x8a150019-command-requires-admin", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A machine-scope installer needs elevation the process lacks; either elevate or request PackageScope.User where supported."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_accessdenied_sources", "label": "AccessDenied adding/removing sources", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#accessdenied-addingremoving-sources", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Source add/remove modify machine-wide state and require an elevated caller; this is WinGet behavior, not the library's."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_arp_ids", "label": "ARP\\ ids in the installed catalog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#search-returns-entries-with-arp-ids", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not an error: the installed catalog includes software installed outside WinGet keyed by its raw Apps-and-Features registry entry. Such entries cannot be targeted by id for install/upgrade, so update UIs should filter on the ARP\\ prefix."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_export_nonzero_exit", "label": "Export exits non-zero but the file exists", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#export-exits-non-zero-but-the-file-exists", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "winget export exits non-zero when some installed applications aren't available in any configured source, yet still writes the file for everything it could map, so 'file written' is the practical success signal."}, {"id": "docs_troubleshooting_system_service_context", "label": "Running under SYSTEM / as a Windows Service", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#running-under-system--as-a-windows-service", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two caveats inherited from WinGet itself: no App Execution Alias exists in service contexts (the CLI shim already falls back to the WindowsApps package directory), and install-scope preference in profile-less contexts can behave unexpectedly \u2014 enterprise deployments patch winget's own settings.json to default to machine scope. This path is not covered by the test suite."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_troubleshooting_regdb_e_classnotreg", "target": "docs_getting_started_direct_interop_reference_rule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#comexception-0x80040154-regdb_e_classnotreg-at-runtime", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_wingetunavailable_causes", "target": "docs_architecture_wingetunavailableexception", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#wingetunavailableexception", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_wingetunavailable_causes", "target": "docs_architecture_activation_chain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#wingetunavailableexception", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_invalidcastexception_enumeration", "target": "docs_architecture_indexed_for_loop_rule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#invalidcastexception-no-such-interface-supported-while-enumerating", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_invalidcastexception_enumeration", "target": "docs_architecture_iwingetclient", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#invalidcastexception-no-such-interface-supported-while-enumerating", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_installer_prohibits_elevation", "target": "docs_usage_packages_getdetails", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#install-fails-with-0x8a150056-installer-prohibits-elevation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_installer_prohibits_elevation", "target": "docs_architecture_wingeterrorcodes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#install-fails-with-0x8a150056-installer-prohibits-elevation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_command_requires_admin", "target": "docs_architecture_wingeterrorcodes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#install-fails-with-0x8a150019-command-requires-admin", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_command_requires_admin", "target": "docs_usage_packages_installrequest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#install-fails-with-0x8a150019-command-requires-admin", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_accessdenied_sources", "target": "docs_usage_sources_addsource", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#accessdenied-addingremoving-sources", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_accessdenied_sources", "target": "docs_usage_sources_removesource", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#accessdenied-addingremoving-sources", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_arp_ids", "target": "docs_usage_packages_getinstalled", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#search-returns-entries-with-arp-ids", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_export_nonzero_exit", "target": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_export", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#export-exits-non-zero-but-the-file-exists", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_system_service_context", "target": "docs_usage_pins_export_import_winget_exe_resolution", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/troubleshooting.md", "source_location": "docs/troubleshooting.md#running-under-system--as-a-windows-service", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_troubleshooting_system_service_context", "target": "docs_usage_packages_installrequest", "relation": "conceptually_rela